ang="fa-AF" dir="rtl">دری</option><option value="de-li-hueckelhoven" lang="de" dir="ltr">Hückelhovener Platt · Deutsch</option></select></label></div></header><p id="dps-dialect" hidden="hidden"></p><main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="hero-top"><div class="brand"><img src="/assets/marcas/konfirmu.svg" width="45" height="45" alt="Konfirmu"><div class="wordmark">Konfirm<span>u</span></div></div><span class="status" data-dt="120">Public offline app</span></div><div class="hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-dt="121">The Girafinhas challenge</p><h1 data-dt="122">The note says seven. What do you see?</h1><p class="lead" data-dt="123">Count the bowls on the savannah. Then open KONFIRMU to find out how to check whether someone changed the note.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/konfirmu/app/" data-dt="124">Open the public offline app</a><a class="button kh-book" href="/konfirmu/livro/Konfirmu_Livro_Vivo.html#language" data-dt="125">Open the Living Book</a><small data-kt="originalBookHint" class="dps-book-hint">Choose your reading language in the book. The activities in this edition are in Portuguese.</small><a href="/konfirmu/livro/girafa/" class="button kh-book" data-dt="126">Read the illustrated giraffe story in 35 language editions</a><a href="/konfirmu/filme/" class="button kh-book" data-dt="127">Watch the giraffe film</a><a href="/konfirmu/livro/girafa/#aula" class="button kh-book" data-dt="128">Open the classroom activity</a><a href="/konfirmu/downloads/regua-da-terra-observatorio.zip" class="button kh-book" data-dt="129">Download the Earth Observatory pack</a><a href="/konfirmu/precos/Konfirmu-Mundo-12-Setores.zip" class="button kh-book" data-kt="kit" download="">Download the 12-sector kit</a><a href="#prisma" class="button kh-book" data-dt="130">Try the interactive prism</a><a class="textlink" href="#vision" data-dt="119">Explore the vision <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="textlink" href="mailto:info@