<section class="instrument"><div class="wide inst-grid"><div><h2 data-t="compareTitle">Compare the two reports</h2><p data-t="prismIntro">Two sample reports identify a welded joint. Compare each file with the original. A single digit has changed.</p></div><div class="inst-controls"><div class="toolrow"><label><span class="sr" data-t="sector">Sector</span><select id="sector"></select></label><button type="button" id="motion" data-t="pause">Pause</button><button type="button" id="tilt" data-t="tilt">Tilt</button><button type="button" id="record" data-t="record">Record for 8 seconds</button><a id="clip" hidden data-t="saveVideo">Save video</a></div><span role="status" id="hint" data-t="tiltHint">Drag the prism or use the arrow keys.</span><details><summary data-t="digest">Show SHA-256 hash values</summary><dl><dt data-t="reference">Reference value from the receipt</dt><dd id="ref" dir="ltr"></dd><dt data-t="selected">Value calculated from the selected file</dt><dd id="out" dir="ltr"></dd></dl><a class="lic" href="/assets/dps-h3-license.txt">H3 · Apache-2.0 ↗</a></details></div></div></section>
</section><div class="strip"><div class="wrap"><b data-dt="144">Before leaving. On arrival. In everyday life.</b><span data-dt="145">For people who live, study and work abroad.</span></div></div><section class="section" id="vision"><div class="wrap"><div class="intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-dt="146">What we are building</p><h2 data-dt="147">Your life is bigger<br data-dtail="148">than one letter.</h2></div><div><p class="body-copy" data-dt="149">A new generation of intelligent support for administrative and working life. Starting in the Netherlands, with European ambitions. Konfirmu is being developed as a personal system for administrative and professional organisation. Documents, deadlines, pay, work and expenses belong to the same life — and need to make sense together.</p><p class="note" data-dt="150">These administrative services are in development. The public file comparator and educational books are available now. Each resource shows its own language options.</p></div></div><div class="areas"><article class="area"><h3 data-dt="151">Documents and communication</h3><p data-dt="152">Letters, contracts, translation, voice and draft responses.</p></article><article class="area"><h3 data-dt="153">Work and pay</h3><p data-dt="154">Payslips, working hours, mileage, CVs and applications.</p></article><article class="area"><h3 data-dt="155">Expenses and month-end</h3><p data-dt="156">Records, invoicing and preparing information for an accountant.</p></article><article class="area"><h3 data-dt="157">Life abroad</h3><p data-dt="158">Arrival, housing, studies, services and preparing to return home.</p></article><article class="area"><h3 data-dt="159">Rights and support</h3><p data-dt="160">Official sources, practical information and routes to human help.</p></article><article class="area"><h3 data-dt="161">My Case</h3><p data-dt="162">Documents, confirmed facts, deadlines and next steps kept connected.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="wrap case-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-dt="163">A new direction</p><h2 data-dt="164">From the first question<br data-dtail="165">to the next step.</h2><p class="body-copy" data-dt="166">We are connecting the pieces around each person’s case: understanding the situation, gathering what is missing and preparing the next action. With sources to consult and decisions that remain yours.</p></div><div class="flow"><p data-dt="167">Understand the situation<span data-dt="168">Documents and facts you confirm.</span></p><p data-dt="169">Prepare the next step<span data-dt="170">Information, deadlines and drafts to review.</span></p><p data-dt="171">Keep the case moving<span data-dt="172">What has been done, what is missing and what needs a response.</span></p></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="api"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-dt="173">Organisations and platforms</p><h2 data-dt="174">The same mission.<br data-dtail="175">More ways to reach people.</h2><p class="body-copy" data-dt="176">The new direction includes an API and a connector for digital assistants. The aim is to bring “Understand. Confirm. Act.” to other points where people seek support.</p><p class="note" data-dt="177">Integration work is being tested. The public comparator and educational publications are available separately; operational pilots are agreed with DPS.</p></div><div class="api-points"><div class="api-row"><b data-dt="178">“Confirma isto” API</b><span data-dt="179">A connection for software to consult the Konfirmu engine.</span></div><div class="api-row"><b data-dt="180">Assistant connector</b><span data-dt="181">MCP: a route to integration with digital assistants.</span></div><div class="api-row"><b data-dt="182">Working with organisations</b><span data-dt="183">Conversations about future pilots and access to information.</span></div></div></div><p class="body-copy institution" data-dt="184">Businesses, associations and public bodies: we are preparing ways to collaborate and private pilots, defined case by case.</p><div class="principles"><article><h3 data-dt="185">The decision is yours.</h3><p data-dt="186">Technology should support your autonomy. You confirm the facts and choose the next step. Nothing is sent without your consent.</p></article><article><h3 data-dt="187">Information needs a source.</h3><p data-dt="188">We want to make the origin of information and the need for confirmation visible.</p><a class="textlink" href="/konfirmu/recursos/Konfirmu_O_que_sabemos_PT_publico_2026-11-26.pdf" type="application/pdf" hreflang="pt-PT" data-dt="189">What we know about Konfirmu (PDF in Portuguese)</a><p><a class="textlink" href="/konfirmu/viagem/edicoes/EN-GB" hreflang="en-GB" data-dt="190">Read and play The Little Giraffe’s Eight Bowls (UK English)</a> <a class="textlink" href="/konfirmu/pt2030/en/">The Little Giraffes: an invitation to educators and communities</a></p><a class="textlink" href="/konfirmu/downloads/regua-da-terra-observatorio.zip" type="application/zip" data-dt="191">Download the Earth Observatory educational pack (ZIP)</a></article><article><h3 data-dt="192">Equal opportunity is the purpose.</h3><p data-dt="193">We work to reduce barriers of language, information and access to opportunity.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section soft" id="plans"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow" data-dt="194">Planned options</p><h2 data-dt="195">One Konfirmu.<br data-dtail="196">Different ways to have it by your side.</h2><div class="plans"><article><h3>Free</h3><p data-dt="197">An initial way to address everyday needs.</p></article><article><h3>Case Pass</h3><p data-dt="198">A focused journey for a specific situation.</p></article><article><h3>Pro</h3><p data-dt="199">Continuity for working life and regular use.</p></article><article><h3>Premium</h3><p data-dt="200">More possibilities for intensive use, multiple cases and family.</p></article></div><p class="plan-promise" data-dt="201">Access may vary. Our commitment to accuracy and sources stays the same.</p><p class="note" data-dt="202">The public pricing page explains indicative options and the 30-day pilot. Contact DPS to check current scope, eligibility and availability.</p><p><a class="textlink" href="/konfirmu/precos/l/en/" data-dt="203">Worldwide prices and the 30-day pilot</a></p></div></section><section class="closing"><p class="eyebrow" data-dt="204">Public resources and future services</p><h2 data-dt="205">Talent belongs to everyone.<br data-dtail="206">Opportunity should too.</h2><p data-dt="207">A future with fewer barriers is taking shape. Follow the next chapter of Konfirmu.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:info@dpsindustrial.nl?subject=Konfirmu%20%E2%80%94%20keep%20me%20informed" data-dt="208">Keep me informed about Konfirmu ↗</a> <a class="textlink" href="/konfirmu/app/offline.zip" download data-dt="209">Download the pilot and the book for offline use</a><p class="small" data-dt="210">Write to us to learn about the project and what is coming next.<br data-dtail="211">The public app and books are available. Contact DPS for news of future services.</p></section></main><footer><div class="wrap foot"><div><div class="brand"><img src="/assets/konfirmu-coming-soon/konfirmu-k3d.svg" width="45" height="45" alt=""><div class="wordmark">Konfirm<span>u</span></div></div><div data-dt="116">Equal opportunities. Our reason to innovate.</div></div><a href="/" data-dt="212">Back to the DPS website ↗</a><a href="mailto:info@dpsindustrial.nl">info@dpsindustrial.nl</a></div><div class="wrap foot-details"><a href="tel:+31685408926">+31 6 854 089 26</a><span>G.J. van Heekstraat 272 · 7521 EL Enschede</span><a href="/privacy" data-dt="213">Privacy and cookies</a></div></footer><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a611c9e15a83fc66',t:'MTc5NTc4OTM4Mw==